  "title": "Journal v2: validated, indexed, replayable run journals",
  "summary": "Replaces the single-file journal module with a five-part journal subsystem: a versioned event model (event.rs) with ten payload types, a JSON Schema (event.schema.json) validated on every append and read, a documented hash layout (hash.rs) that adds a separate replay digest over decision fields only, a per-work-item run index (index.rs) guarded by an fs4 file lock, and a strict reader (reader.rs) that refuses a broken chain rather than returning a partial list. Journals move from `<state>/buffer` to `<state>/runs`, gain work-item and change context, and a new `osf run start|complete` CLI drives a run's lifecycle.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
