      "group": "journal",
      "subtitle": "event.rs",
      "summary": "One envelope (schema_version, run, work_item, change, actor, timestamp_ms, cost, payload, prev_hash, hash) and ten payload types: run-started, verification, review, finding, state-change, run-complete, attention, checkpoint-complete, review-answer, review-decision. Adds ActorKind (harness/person/system), EvidenceGrade, WorkItemState and BlockedCause.",
