      "group": "journal",
      "subtitle": "draft 2020-12",
      "summary": "The schema every event is checked against. Conditional `allOf` blocks pick the payload shape by `event_type`; cross-field rules refuse a `verified_by` on non-observed findings, a `blocked` state change without a cause, a cause on any other state, and a harness actor without a model.",
